# @ratio/gokwik is a library — it has no environment of its own and never reads process.env.
# The consuming app injects config via the IntegrationContext (ctx.env); see apps/origin/.env.example.
#
# Keys this package reads from ctx.env (the host must provide them, or the widget stays off):
#   GOKWIK_ENVIRONMENT          production | sandbox   (shared by checkout + side-cart)
#   GOKWIK_BASE_SCRIPT_URL      core GoKwik SDK (used by checkout)
#   GOKWIK_SIDECART_SCRIPT_URL  KwikCart side-cart drawer script
#   GOKWIK_CURRENCY             e.g. INR
#   GOKWIK_CURRENCY_FORMAT      e.g. en-IN
